Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.82,0:00:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.04,0:00:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.06,0:00:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.36,0:00:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Go get what you really want.\NI want more. Any one more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.30,0:00:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, open up the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.92,0:00:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.16,0:00:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Run like the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.26,0:00:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Jump high.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.17,0:00:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.09,0:00:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.18,0:00:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe you can achieve your goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.22,0:00:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going on the stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.40,0:00:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it again, you\Nknow what I mean, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.52,0:00:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Know what you're making. My dream time to.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.04,0:00:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you feel it? I\Nreally don't know what is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.80,0:00:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Something is testing me every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.28,0:00:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.58,0:00:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fly away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.56,0:01:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I never wanna come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.64,0:01:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.92,0:01:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fly away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.83,0:01:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The greatest day I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.36,0:01:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Standing up, blowing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.52,0:01:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My dream is getting wild, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.70,0:01:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm no afraid, beat me, hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.68,0:01:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.22,0:01:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Another day, another chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You know it's never too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.20,0:01:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can't do it, so\Ncan you. Only without.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.44,0:01:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.56,0:01:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Party for tomorrow. Go\Nget what you really want.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.66,0:01:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, anyone more.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.72,0:01:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, open up the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.84,0:01:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.02,0:01:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Run like the wind, jump high, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.04,0:01:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.80,0:01:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe you cannot achieve your goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.16,0:01:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going. Rolling.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.14,0:01:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.44,0:01:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting for your wife that I\Nwant, but you're where it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.52,0:01:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, anyone more,\Ncome on, open up the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.40,0:02:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life,\Nshine like a star to be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.64,0:02:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong. Just that\Nyou're gonna kick your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.34,0:02:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going. I'm not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.62,0:02:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You make my day every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.60,0:02:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Doth Flamingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.20,0:02:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at you two, huddled\Ntogether in your little hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.86,0:02:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I take those\Nhandcuffs off for you long?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.78,0:02:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Or should I cut your\Nwrists along with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.88,0:02:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you were at the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.26,0:02:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.60,0:03:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I came to rescue you, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.84,0:03:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You clearly need help if you're\Nfalling for traps like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.26,0:03:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll put you out of your misery.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.84,0:03:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.22,0:03:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Bullet string.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.34,0:03:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the ball. Get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.04,0:03:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,no sense of self-preservation
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.56,0:03:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,don't die Lucy it's okay what
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.46,0:03:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,a joke look at you any clown\Ncould kill you in this sorry state
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.02,0:03:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,you've riled up quite an army of idiots\Nout there thinking they can take my head
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.68,0:04:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,you are quite adept at bringing\Npeople to your side no matter
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.88,0:04:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,how foolish it may seem i've\Nadmired that quality of yours
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.76,0:04:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,since i saw it on display during\Nthe battle at marineford but
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.74,0:04:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,now i see you're just some fool\Nwhose luck has finally run out
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.08,0:04:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you side with this idiot, Law?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.36,0:04:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,When you were young, I thought you\Nshowed a great deal of promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.40,0:04:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Even as a child, you were\Nmore cunning than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.24,0:04:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And more ruthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.08,0:04:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.84,0:04:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.06,0:04:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Who made you into such a miserable\Nlittle coward? That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.34,0:04:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.04,0:04:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna be like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.34,0:04:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.32,0:04:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.14,0:04:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,By my dear brother Corazon, you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.88,0:04:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You're worse than a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.24,0:04:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You're useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.64,0:05:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You made a choice, not only to die in\Nvain, but to do it alongside this imbecile.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.40,0:05:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.88,0:05:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your hands off Strahan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.18,0:05:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Or you'll be sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.16,0:05:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not the real thing. It's just a\Nclone, oh, a puppet made of string.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.08,0:05:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you guys. Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.66,0:05:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad we came.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.12,0:05:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, let's get him out of\Nthat water already, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.96,0:05:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.87,0:05:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.82,0:05:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.24,0:05:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it was nothing. One question.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.94,0:05:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Did we win?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.12,0:05:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just legs now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.74,0:05:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the guy we were supposed\Nto fight at the palace, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.92,0:05:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.83,0:05:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I just told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.86,0:05:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only his puppet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.34,0:06:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I don't know why he bothered\Nto send one all the way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.62,0:06:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Does he want to taunt us that badly?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.60,0:06:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That reminds me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.98,0:06:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That Kelly Funk guy from\Nbefore, he tricked us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.98,0:06:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything that bastard said was a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.58,0:06:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Kid's a real sucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.36,0:06:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He walks straight into that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.28,0:06:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,After we learned what he was\Nplotting, we knew we had to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.48,0:06:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Drahat needs our help!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.04,0:06:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up, Abdullah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.36,0:06:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Kelly's a famous assassin, and he\Ncut him down in a split second.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.18,0:06:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, man, that's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.52,0:06:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Mingo did rescue me. Treffy is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.50,0:06:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He's laughing at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.94,0:06:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,How's Chopper doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.54,0:06:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he beating us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.62,0:06:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we're falling way behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.48,0:06:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.58,0:07:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone might be on the second\Nlevel. Ah, we gotta get to the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.44,0:07:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,sunflower field I needed that shortcut
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.64,0:07:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,hurry back to the entrance what
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.92,0:07:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,all those losers made it\Nup to the second level
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.86,0:07:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Already that's crazy. Our we're\Non the leads, I'll lose ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.76,0:07:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't see Straw Hat\Nor his crew out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.96,0:07:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start picking him off, one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.70,0:07:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Elephant gun, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.30,0:07:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that? Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.84,0:07:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's coming our way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.58,0:07:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't even know what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.34,0:07:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no right to be scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.20,0:07:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You keep fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.26,0:07:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't lose sight of the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.20,0:07:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He made a shortcut with his face!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.36,0:08:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.27,0:08:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You take care of Moosey for me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.10,0:08:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.24,0:08:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ya-ho-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.86,0:08:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm enjoying this chaos!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.04,0:08:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Change how all the others are\Nheaded to the third level!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.14,0:08:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop them! Ah! What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.74,0:08:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That hole...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.68,0:08:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,it came out of nowhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.90,0:08:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,A hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.80,0:08:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.16,0:08:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.50,0:08:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that law I see?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.54,0:08:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the hold-up? Move it! All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.68,0:08:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming for you, Mingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.86,0:08:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They're too small!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.46,0:08:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.37,0:08:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.29,0:08:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, hold on to these ropes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.20,0:08:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We're too heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.44,0:08:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way they can carry us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.52,0:09:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's leave the bugs and run instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.96,0:09:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.87,0:09:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.02,0:09:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I'll tell you how this works.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.24,0:09:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You aren't listening, are ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.52,0:09:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Tantata Airline\NSpecial Jumping Service.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.36,0:09:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Big people are too heavy to\Nfly on their backs, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.68,0:09:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.10,0:09:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no more time to explain!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.14,0:09:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Get a running start and take off! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.20,0:09:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not flying, we're falling!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.94,0:09:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Leo, please don't kill our friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.10,0:09:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.00,0:09:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If I fall to my death,\NI'm gonna hurt you, rants!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.94,0:09:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This is like flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.80,0:09:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If nothing else, we can\Nmake you all fall slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.52,0:09:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Those buildings are\Ngetting closer and closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.16,0:09:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine, relax!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.52,0:09:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But how is this relaxing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.00,0:10:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna crash!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.56,0:10:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to aim for a rooftop!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.34,0:10:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? A rooftop?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.86,0:10:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.18,0:10:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Land softly and keep running.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.14,0:10:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go! Jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.10,0:10:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.62,0:10:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,If you keep kicking off the\Nrooftops, you can stay in the air!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.98,0:10:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Very clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.82,0:10:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'm catching on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.06,0:10:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you're really soaring!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.46,0:10:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, I feel like a balloon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.98,0:10:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone still might\Nattack us, so watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.90,0:11:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, just head for the\Nfourth level of the big plateau!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.60,0:11:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger that. Roger that. Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.60,0:11:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.96,0:11:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a plan that'll get\Nthe door to the factory open!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.70,0:11:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.52,0:11:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Definitely!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.43,0:11:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Just keep fighting Senor for now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.50,0:11:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We need time to pull this off!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.64,0:11:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy peasy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.54,0:11:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You can count on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.94,0:11:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard, how dare you step on my sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.30,0:11:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I? Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.12,0:12:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This is one hell of a fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.64,0:12:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, Doofy, did you send\NStrain Joker off somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.18,0:12:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I was gonna deliver something,\Nbut I guess he doesn't need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.26,0:12:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,While we're sitting here waiting, do you\Nremember the day when Law first showed up?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.28,0:12:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,all those years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.56,0:12:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He was crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.70,0:12:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Had a wild look in his eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.76,0:12:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.78,0:12:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Reminded me of myself when I\Nwas that age, to be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.72,0:12:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought in 10 years, this hateful little\Nmonster will make a fine right-hand man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.34,0:13:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,but now it looks like i'll be\Nkilling him instead, such a pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.80,0:13:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,we have an intruder—don't touch him—he\Nhas explosives strapped to his body.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.46,0:13:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,hey, who
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.26,0:13:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,the hell is this kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.00,0:13:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,let me join your pirate crew—i\Nwant to destroy everything that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.14,0:13:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,destroy everything that
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.26,0:13:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.17,0:13:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,People, towns.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.78,0:13:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to bring this\Nwhole world to the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.06,0:13:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I'm from
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.78,0:13:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Vlevens, but I came here\Nfrom the White Town.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.10,0:13:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't be long before\NI'm dead. I'm dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.74,0:13:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Minko!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.40,0:14:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,How strange to be feeling\Nsentimental at a time like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.00,0:14:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't suppose you're going to tell\Nme you killed Straw Hat like I asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.02,0:14:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you send Deliger to take me out?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.04,0:14:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Was he really doing that\Non your order like he said?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.84,0:14:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.94,0:14:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.44,0:14:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there any hope for me to join you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.02,0:14:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You really want me to\Nspell it out for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.36,0:14:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.54,0:14:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Your purpose has never been the\Nsame as mine, even from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.64,0:14:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,For example, you always\Nwanted to be a pirate, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.54,0:14:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Me, not so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.26,0:15:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The methods didn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.16,0:15:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.64,0:15:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,For the only thing I care about.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.64,0:15:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroying this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.62,0:15:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way, child!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.88,0:15:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in quite the hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.08,0:15:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.52,0:15:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'm just a child?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.86,0:15:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You may not be the beheader.\NDoesn't that sound scary?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.70,0:15:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He's fast. So how many hits have\Nyou taken? A hundred? A thousand?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.62,0:15:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If I recall, you were a war executioner\Nright I love executions, too! You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.40,0:15:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a kicker!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.30,0:15:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.20,0:16:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over already.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.36,0:16:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.80,0:16:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The executives are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.80,0:16:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I'll be reaching the\Nthird level before anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.56,0:16:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What are these strange bulbous masses?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.74,0:16:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful, it's not safe there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.00,0:16:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Mine, pop.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.22,0:16:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa! Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.48,0:16:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on my way! Da-ee!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.04,0:16:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Floaty-floaty!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.94,0:16:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten-ton lights!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.76,0:16:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, suck on that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.48,0:16:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The family executives are\Ngoing to brutalize you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.20,0:17:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Sucker!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.34,0:17:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You losers aren't going anywhere now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.20,0:17:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.30,0:17:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Arms morphosis!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.68,0:17:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Revolver leg!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.22,0:17:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.38,0:17:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring the rope, quick! And treat him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.70,0:17:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He's been shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.46,0:17:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to put out the fire. Ready? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.88,0:17:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.32,0:17:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.94,0:17:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I was about to kill my own family.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.72,0:17:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I set the town on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.90,0:17:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.28,0:17:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I cut up my own best friend. So did I.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.00,0:17:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It was awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.50,0:17:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody blames you for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.36,0:17:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.50,0:17:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We all know this is Doflamingo's work.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.00,0:17:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta bring an end to\Nthis sadistic game somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.50,0:18:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.41,0:18:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I was looking around and found King Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.80,0:18:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's got that five-star\Ngod Usopp guy with him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.00,0:18:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.82,0:18:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, but we're only capturing them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.78,0:18:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.40,0:18:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.31,0:18:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,There's been enough killing today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.52,0:18:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's put an end to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.60,0:18:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Move in quick, then take King Rick\Nand god Usopp as hostages. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.26,0:18:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we can use them to lure in\Nthe others with star bounties.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.78,0:18:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.68,0:18:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell everyone you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.82,0:18:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll all come together at\Nthe Old King's Plateau. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.66,0:18:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you lazy bugs doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.62,0:18:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you idiots knock over this SAD tank?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.44,0:18:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's spilling everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.98,0:18:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, pick it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.56,0:19:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.98,0:19:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.00,0:19:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,There was an earthquake out of the blue,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.88,0:19:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,and then before we knew\Nit, the tank fell flat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.16,0:19:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.30,0:19:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Did something cause that earthquake?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.16,0:19:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut your hole!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.24,0:19:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to worry about that stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.18,0:19:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.09,0:19:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.10,0:19:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to cure Princess\NMonterey's illness or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.34,0:19:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What if she dies, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.52,0:19:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course we want to save her!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.36,0:19:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,How is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.38,0:19:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't heard in a while!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.74,0:19:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to say that the princess\Nisn't getting any better at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.34,0:19:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.84,0:19:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us see the princess just once.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.20,0:19:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You're such a little nuisance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.48,0:19:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up and get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.10,0:19:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Those smiles aren't\Ngoing to make themselves,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.54,0:19:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,so stop gawking or you're\Nall going to get the whip.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.04,0:19:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.88,0:20:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I not speaking loud\Nenough, you dimwits?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.22,0:20:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit zoning out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.86,0:20:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.40,0:20:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Those letters, they're...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.14,0:20:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The pink bees!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.28,0:20:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.44,0:20:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.38,0:20:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.29,0:20:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,They noticed us, Beyond!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.50,0:20:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.42,0:20:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, team, the next message!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.42,0:20:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, we got fooled?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.00,0:20:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.08,0:20:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,If you won't listen, I'm gonna\Nmake the whip do the talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.74,0:20:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Fooled about the princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.34,0:20:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Fooled about her illness?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.00,0:20:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo has been lying\Nto keep us trapped here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.64,0:21:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I got no choice\Nbut to beat it into you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.20,0:21:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what's going on, but\Nthere's one thing I'm sure of.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.96,0:21:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,My friends wouldn't lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.90,0:21:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, underlings!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.08,0:21:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's Drawhead!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.46,0:21:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So Flamingo's up at the\Ntop of this place, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.30,0:21:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Cabbage, you try to get in my way again!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.08,0:21:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Not this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.60,0:21:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hop on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.30,0:21:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Not my first choice, but I've\Ndecided to give you a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.42,0:22:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.02,0:22:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to get to Doflamingo\Nquickly, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.70,0:22:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.82,0:22:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get going! Ride!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.84,0:22:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What a small hint of gratitude!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.42,0:22:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.33,0:22:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Just make the horse go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.62,0:22:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me what to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.18,0:22:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Farul.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.78,0:22:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, if the executives catch\Nus, we'll be stuck here for ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.70,0:22:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll cut through the wall and make a path.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.84,0:22:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You knock the enemies out of our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.88,0:22:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.79,0:22:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll push through to the\Nthird level in one shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.16,0:22:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.07,0:22:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,When the hell did we pick\Nup an extra passenger?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.72,0:22:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.24,0:22:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing on my horse?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.30,0:22:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Riding.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.21,0:22:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I followed Luffyland's trail\Nand it brought me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.54,0:22:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Get off! Lucky break.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.30,0:22:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I was looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.58,0:22:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care if you're friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.02,0:22:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Four's too many.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.22,0:22:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna meet up with\NRebecca after we go up a level.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.68,0:22:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca's in enemy territory?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.34,0:22:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't stop her?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.76,0:22:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ignore me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.22,0:22:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,She's headed up to the sunflower\Nfield to deliver a key to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.52,0:22:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But she's on the wanted list.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.88,0:22:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What if somebody captures her?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.46,0:22:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.37,0:22:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,My friends are there to protect her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.78,0:22:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.69,0:23:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,My elegant steed can't maintain its\Nelegance with four people on its back!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.88,0:23:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I was more comfortable riding on the bull.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.76,0:23:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, Pops, why did you\Ntake off in such a hurry before?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.52,0:23:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,My goal in this is the same as yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.62,0:23:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I must liberate this kingdom and beat\NO 'Flamingo as swiftly as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.66,0:23:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.36,0:23:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A personal matter that I must settle.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.52,0:23:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,A top executive that I must\Nkill with my own two hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.06,0:23:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's fine, but don't die trying. Okay,\Nof course not, I won't be defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.06,0:23:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,with my true body okay then not okay\Nget off why don't you get off this
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.62,0:23:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,is my horse you're the worst of the\Nwhole worst generation watch where
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.06,0:23:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,you're going we're gonna crash look\Nlike i said don't Tell me what to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.54,0:23:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.86,0:23:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.32,0:23:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.20,0:23:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll keep them busy, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.10,0:23:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.01,0:24:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,They're a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.22,0:24:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All of a sudden, Enel.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.86,0:24:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,They were one step away from\Nfighting each other a second ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.92,0:24:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.83,0:24:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But what's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.16,0:24:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're friends now?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.62,0:24:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a famous tactician.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.64,0:24:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And this is war.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.90,0:24:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I helped them realize we need\Neach other to grasp victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.62,0:24:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Dagama may be a rat, but\Nhis plan makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.84,0:24:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Our best bet is to help Straw Hat win.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.14,0:24:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So get moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.50,0:24:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You take out the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.00,0:24:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll keep the executives busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.18,0:24:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him there, Cavendish.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.74,0:24:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And make it quick! I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.88,0:24:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So I've been reduced to a chauffeur.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.06,0:24:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give him an inch! You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.06,0:24:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent work!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.56,0:24:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like that stubby\Nguy is calling the shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.48,0:24:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll stomp him out!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.66,0:25:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Garamon took a big hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.04,0:25:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.95,0:25:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let go of me, you jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.80,0:25:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep going, Straw Hat Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.40,0:25:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look back!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.90,0:25:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Open fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.54,0:25:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep them down there at any cost!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.82,0:25:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Blade of beauty, sans-t-ex-zu-peri!
